                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>Note:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'> In the cases &apos;Churning&apos; and &apos;Inactive&apos;,  loyalty here refers to the last month in which the the respective customer placed an order.</run>
                    <run>&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;Legend:&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>NL </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'>= Not Loyal</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>x NL </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'>= Not Loyal and x Lifetime Orders</run>
