                <run bold='true' fontsize='8'>Æ </run>
                <run fontsize='8'>Customer Base</run>
                <run bold='true' fontsize='8'>Æ </run>
                <run fontsize='8'>for all the entities is calculated based on ACID except that </run>
                <run bold='true' fontsize='8'>FD-Denmark</run>
                <run fontsize='8'> and </run>
                <run bold='true' fontsize='8'>Mjam</run>
                <run fontsize='8'> are </run>
                <run fontsize='8' underline='true'>based on External ID</run>
                <run fontsize='8'>.</run>
