                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontsize='8'>**</run>
                    <run fontsize='8'> Reachable users on Braze are based on the </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontsize='8'>last 24 months</run>
                    <run fontsize='8'>. That&apos;s why, </run>
                    <run fontsize='8' underline='true'>there can be differences between Reachable users on Braze and Customer Base on Tableau.</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
